Package: shinyquota
Title: Simple Usage Quotas for Shiny Applications
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Kunst", , "56481+jbkunst@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a small and deliberately simple way to limit access to a
    Shiny application by client IP. Access windows, cooldown periods, and
    session history are stored through 'DBI', allowing the same interface to
    work with SQLite and PostgreSQL.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jbkunst/shinyquota
BugReports: https://github.com/jbkunst/shinyquota/issues
